  "description": "<p><strong>Major thank you to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/34125-grooveypenguinx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GrooveypenguinX</a> and the rest of the WTT group for letting me use their codebase, And to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/11585-zhorabzhora/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Zhorabzhora</a> for making the original weapon mod, <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/1652-samswat/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SamSWAT</a> for helping with the original mod, and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/56875-qwertyalex/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Qwertyalex</a> for helping with the assort</strong></p>\n<p><strong>GUN MAY OR MAY NOT CRASH YOUR GAME, IF IT DOES DONT USE IT</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/352-tkpd-9-3x64-carbine/#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Zhorabzhora’s TKPD 9.3X64 Carbine</a></p>\n<p>Contains everything from the original mod (except the foregrip since its the same one from ValMod3)</p>\n<p>Realism Patch Included <strong>(Don’t install the SPT-Realism folder if you dont have the Realism mod)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>HOW TO INSTALL</strong></p>\n<p>Drag and drop the folder into your root spt folder</p>\n<p>Enjoy!!</p>\n",
